    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "it's not even that i'm trying to remember. it's like... the person who lived here, the person who had a reason to do things, that person is just gone. it's like the engine is out and i'm just a shell being pushed around by habit. i wake up, i eat, i sit here. there's no point to any of it, it's just a loop of nothing.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
