      "content": "but what if there is no next chapter? what if i'm not even the author anymore? it feels like i'm just a ghost that forgot to leave, just lingering in a life that doesn't belong to me. it feels so much easier to just... let go of the struggle and stop trying to find a spark that isn't there.",
